WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:44.940
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:45.210 --> 00:47.170
Sunwoo...

3
00:47.170 --> 00:49.380
You're a real beast, aren't you?

4
01:12.570 --> 01:14.870
Don't look away, Lee Sunwoo.

5
01:14.870 --> 01:17.490
Don't look at that bastard, just look at me.

6
01:26.130 --> 01:29.050
Focus on me...

7
01:38.850 --> 01:41.100
Mr. Kang.

8
01:41.100 --> 01:48.940
Watch closely how the employee you sent away is catering to him.

9
02:01.450 --> 02:03.290
Ah, Sunwoo...

10
02:06.460 --> 02:09.210
- Yeah, this is it. - Wait...

11
02:11.170 --> 02:13.720
Team Leader Kang is killing it.

12
02:28.440 --> 02:32.110
This is what you guys wanted, isn't it?

13
02:49.840 --> 02:54.380
Go Tae-woon / Kim Do-hyun

14
03:06.270 --> 03:10.940
Baek Seung-hoon / Lee Kyung-won

15
03:22.450 --> 03:29.880
Twisted Tie

16
03:29.880 --> 03:33.170
Episode 5. Finally Complete

17
03:39.930 --> 03:41.050
Hello!

18
03:41.050 --> 03:42.510
- Hello, sir. - Hello.

19
03:42.510 --> 03:43.680
Ah, yes, yes.

20
03:43.680 --> 03:46.640
- You must have come a long way. Have some coffee. - Ah, thank you.

21
03:46.640 --> 03:49.730
- Here you go. - Thank you.

22
03:49.730 --> 03:52.770
- Ah, sir, this is... - Oh.

23
03:53.230 --> 03:57.780
Oh, you shouldn't have brought all this. Thank you so much.

24
03:57.780 --> 04:00.280
I'll enjoy this, first of all.

25
04:01.410 --> 04:06.750
Well, I looked over the floor plan from last time, and the color... this is...

26
04:06.750 --> 04:09.670
- Ah, is this it? The one we talked about... - Ah, yes.

27
04:09.670 --> 04:13.500
Following our internal meeting, the atmosphere for that room has changed a bit.

28
04:13.500 --> 04:16.970
We were just wondering if there were other colors available.

29
04:16.970 --> 04:21.010
Back then, wasn't it this, this, this one? Wood White. The order has already been placed...

30
04:21.010 --> 04:25.220
Ah, Wood White was correct, sir, but right now, we want a mood that's a bit more...

31
04:25.220 --> 04:29.190
...deep, so we came to check if you have a Walnut color.

32
04:29.190 --> 04:31.060
- Ah, this color? - Ah, yes, exactly.

33
04:31.060 --> 04:34.860
But for a bright and slightly... that kind of color...

34
04:34.860 --> 04:37.740
- Would it be possible to change to this Walnut color? - Ah, this Walnut color?

35
04:37.740 --> 04:40.030
Yes, could you check on that?

36
04:41.950 --> 04:46.120
- Yes, I'll make a call and see. - Thank you.

37
05:40.550 --> 05:43.890
I don't really like sweets.

38
05:43.890 --> 05:51.930
I know, but it's a nice day today, so just take a bite.

39
06:10.950 --> 06:12.370
That day...

40
06:14.420 --> 06:19.710
When you pushed me away... to go to him, Mr. Kang.

41
06:22.510 --> 06:25.680
I really thought my world was falling apart.

42
06:40.690 --> 06:42.690
Mr. Kang...

43
06:48.990 --> 06:55.370
Never again... will you end up in someone else's arms.

44
06:58.040 --> 07:00.550
I won't let that happen.

45
07:04.550 --> 07:07.090
I'm sorry, Sunwoo.

46
07:07.840 --> 07:10.010
I'm really sorry.

47
07:15.730 --> 07:17.520
Uh, well...

48
07:18.940 --> 07:21.230
That's touching and all, Mr. Kang.

49
07:21.820 --> 07:23.230
Huh?

50
07:24.070 --> 07:27.910
Honestly... three wasn't so bad either.

51
07:28.820 --> 07:30.780
What?... What?

52
07:31.490 --> 07:36.159
Having both you, Mr. Kang, and Mr. Baek beneath me... getting jealous and anxious over me.

53
07:36.159 --> 07:39.040
Well... it was actually a lot more thrilling than I thought.

54
07:40.630 --> 07:44.590
You crazy bastard... In a situation like this, you're...

55
07:45.460 --> 07:49.180
So, don't ever think about sending me somewhere else again.

56
07:49.180 --> 07:52.640
Before I invite both of you into your bed first, Mr. Kang.

57
08:17.500 --> 08:20.920
Mr. Kang, why are your ears still red?

58
08:21.380 --> 08:24.380
Was what I just said that shocking?

59
08:25.340 --> 08:29.840
- Be quiet. I'm done washing, let go. - Come on, your hands are still sticky.

60
08:29.840 --> 08:31.970
Just hold still for a second.

61
08:34.010 --> 08:35.059
Ah!

62
08:36.100 --> 08:37.600
Lee Sunwoo.

63
08:37.600 --> 08:39.480
Did you just splash water on your boss?

64
08:39.480 --> 08:43.150
Oh, my mistake. Oops, my hand slipped.

65
08:43.150 --> 08:45.650
Your fingers were just too sexy.

66
08:46.820 --> 08:48.990
- You're getting cheekier by the minute. - Uh, what are you doing?

67
08:48.990 --> 08:50.990
- Come here. - Uh, uh, uh, uh!

68
08:50.990 --> 08:52.620
Mr. Kang!

69
08:53.450 --> 08:56.620
- Whoa! - You started this, Mr. Kang!

70
09:06.000 --> 09:08.670
This is my revenge. I'm splashing you!

71
09:09.720 --> 09:10.880
Hey!

72
09:23.520 --> 09:24.940
I'm sorry!

73
09:57.560 --> 10:01.230
- Ah, my head... - Why, what's wrong? Does it hurt?

74
10:01.230 --> 10:02.770
Ah, Mr. Kang...

75
10:02.770 --> 10:08.320
Ah, running in the river breeze while soaking wet... I think I've suddenly caught a fever.

76
10:08.320 --> 10:11.820
Ah, I'm getting the chills, too... Ah, my head...

77
10:11.820 --> 10:13.070
- Ah... - A fever?

78
10:13.070 --> 10:13.950
Ah...

79
10:13.950 --> 10:15.570
Do you think you caught a cold?

80
10:16.240 --> 10:18.450
See, I told you. Who told you to splash water first?

81
10:18.450 --> 10:21.620
It'll get worse if you stay in the cold wind...

82
10:21.620 --> 10:25.580
Ugh, I really don't think I can drive all the way back to Seoul like this...

83
10:25.580 --> 10:28.880
Can't we just rest somewhere nearby for a bit?

84
10:28.880 --> 10:32.760
Let's just go in anywhere for now.

85
10:39.350 --> 10:42.480
Ah, my head, ah... Ah, my head...

86
10:42.810 --> 10:44.600
Ah, my head, ah...

87
10:58.160 --> 11:02.160
I said anywhere, but what kind of place is this...

88
11:08.290 --> 11:10.340
Just lie down on the bed for now.

89
11:20.600 --> 11:23.770
Hey, you're burning up right now.

90
11:23.770 --> 11:25.680
I need to find a pharmacy first.

91
11:28.980 --> 11:30.480
Sunwoo...

92
11:37.070 --> 11:40.490
You were right about the fever, Mr. Kang.

93
11:41.080 --> 11:44.580
I'm burning up so much inside, it's driving me crazy.

94
11:46.370 --> 11:50.920
Were you... faking it this whole time just to come here?

95
11:52.250 --> 11:54.960
Ah, you crazy pervert...

96
11:57.470 --> 12:04.850
Because I wanted to start properly with you, Mr. Kang... in the most perfect place.

97
12:04.850 --> 12:09.480
I'll show you a perfect division between business and pleasure now.

98
15:11.450 --> 15:16.290
Why are you looking at me like that? You're going to burn a hole in my face.

99
15:16.790 --> 15:20.250
I'm just fascinated.

100
15:20.250 --> 15:23.380
What? By me?

101
15:26.590 --> 15:29.760
When you first joined our team...

102
15:30.220 --> 15:34.310
you were so clueless and recklessly straightforward...

103
15:34.890 --> 15:38.440
I thought you'd be the first to run away from me.

104
15:39.610 --> 15:44.740
I did get scolded a lot. You were like a block of ice, Mr. Kang.

105
15:44.740 --> 15:48.030
I felt like I'd freeze to death if I got near you.

106
15:50.700 --> 15:52.410
But...

107
15:52.410 --> 15:55.450
you ended up breaking all that ice and coming in.

108
15:58.210 --> 16:02.460
No matter how much I pushed you away or said mean things...

109
16:03.960 --> 16:10.140
that foolish look in your eyes never changed.

110
16:15.180 --> 16:16.930
That's because...

111
16:18.270 --> 16:21.650
I was so crazy about you, Mr. Kang.

112
16:22.440 --> 16:25.690
From the very beginning, all along.

113
16:29.150 --> 16:31.370
I know.

114
16:32.410 --> 16:34.660
That's why I was scared.

115
16:35.290 --> 16:38.790
Because it was an emotion I couldn't control as I pleased.

116
16:41.830 --> 16:43.670
And now?

117
16:46.000 --> 16:48.220
I'm not going to control it anymore.

118
16:54.850 --> 16:58.560
I love you, Lee Sunwoo.

119
17:01.810 --> 17:03.690
Mr. Kang...

120
17:05.770 --> 17:09.109
Are you really calling me "Mr. Kang" in this mood?

121
17:14.829 --> 17:18.119
You really drive me crazy.

122
17:49.780 --> 17:51.900
Dojin...

123
17:53.740 --> 17:55.910
I really...

124
17:55.910 --> 17:58.870
wouldn't mind dying right now.

125
17:59.660 --> 18:03.040
I love you, Dojin.

126
19:01.770 --> 19:04.770
Twisted Tie
